            {
              "id": "8ebae473-8ee1-4986-a513-d5a071dc853e",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "<strong>First Person: War Stories from Gamespace</strong> is a collection of stories edited by Kent Sheely, self-published through Lulu.com, March 25, 2013."
            },
            {
              "id": "83cb0435-22eb-41e0-be33-c6e514dd095d",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "01b72193-daa4-43eb-8faf-53719c269c1c",
              "type": "quote",
              "html": "<em>Avid gamers love to recount their most exciting exploits in online play, especially their moments of greatest challenge, skill, and luck. This is a collection of fifty such War Stories from the battlefields of the Internet: Fifty accounts of valiant struggles, glorious victories, and sometimes of overwhelming defeat.</em>"
            }
          ]
